    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do u mean by \"take the pressure off\"? i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop of worrying about a future that won't even exist. it's like i'm mourning a world that hasn't even died yet. it's hard to see any reason to keep pushing through the day-to-day when the end result is already decided.",
