      "content": "stepping off the stage... that sounds almost peaceful, in a weird way. like, if everything is already broken, why am i forced to keep dragging myself through it? it feels like i'm being punished by having to witness the decline. is that what you're getting at? that there's a kind of dignity in just deciding you've seen enough?",
